~C. The opposing claim has no evidence because advisory is not part of lunch.#Not correct. Choice C says 'The opposing claim has no evidence because advisory is not part of lunch.', which does not fully answer this specific journalism task. Recheck the source details, the question wording, and the mapped standard before choosing the best supported answer.
